<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">17082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Israel's national security minister, Itamar Ben-Gvir, has called for thirty to forty targeted killings in Gaza every night.</s> <s>He doesn't command the army — he runs the police and prisons, and he carries a past conviction for incitement — but a fixed nightly number is untethered from any military objective, and that's precisely the kind of statement war crimes courts weigh as evidence of intent.</s> <s>Whether Israel's government repudiates the words, or simply lets them stand, is now the question.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Cairo, the American envoy Jared Kushner met the Hamas delegation led by Khalil al-Hayya for two hours, pressing the fifteen-point road map for Gaza.</s> <s>Israel has rejected the plan's next phase — the withdrawal and disarmament sequence — while eight Muslim states condemned that refusal in a joint statement of foreign ministers.</s> <s>So the envoy is negotiating implementation with the party meant to disarm, while the party whose consent the plan actually needs has already walked away.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Settlers in the occupied West Bank cut the water supply to the village of Qusra, then encircled Palestinian homes.</s> <s>Rights groups call this land clearance rather than harassment — the army occupies Area C and is legally obliged to protect civilians there, yet prosecutions of settler attacks remain rare enough to be newsworthy when they happen.</s> <s>Pope Leo renewed his call for a two-state solution this week, which tells you how little the diplomacy has moved.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Lahore, two women — Amina and Anmol — died within two hours of being taken into a police station.</s> <s>Their family described bruises and blood that the official record leaves out, and the Human Rights Commission of Pakistan found that police controlled the scene, the postmortem and even access to the burial site.</s> <s>Pakistan criminalised custodial torture four years ago... the number of convictions since is the real measure of whether this case ends differently.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China's coast guard is now patrolling the Pacific waters east of Taiwan, the side of the island that has always been its open back door.</s> <s>Everything Taiwan imports arrives by sea, and the eastern ports of Hualien and Suao are the designated fallback if the Strait is ever closed — so a permanent presence there removes the alternative before any conflict begins.</s> <s>Beijing calls the patrols routine law enforcement, and that's the strategy: a record of quiet administration that becomes a claim of jurisdiction later.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Five years after the Taliban's return, no single faction leads the Afghan opposition.</s> <s>A resistance without territory has no way to make its factions need one another, and diaspora funding rewards splitting rather than merging — which is why the Northern Alliance of the nineteen-nineties cohered and its successors don't.</s> <s>The cost isn't borne by geopolitics but by Afghan women and girls, still barred from schooling and most work, while returns are forced from Pakistan and Iran.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran's army chief has offered thirty thousand dollars to anyone who kills an American soldier.</s> <s>Paying people outside any armed force to kill sits well beyond the laws of war, which govern combatants — and Bahrain, Qatar, Kuwait and the Emirates all host the troops in question.</s> <s>It shifts the risk onto Gulf states that had no say in the quarrel.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Egypt's Sharqiya governorate, a truck crash killed nineteen farm labourers on the road out of Wadi al-Mollak.</s> <s>Survivors are already travelling that same narrow, unlit road again, because contractors pay by the day, there's no written contract, and an open truck bed before dawn is the only way to reach the fields.</s> <s>They'll go a second time, a third, a fourth — not out of resilience, but because there's no other wage.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sudan's army chief, Abdel Fattah el-Burhan, has offered what he calls temporary procedural immunity to those joining political talks in Port Sudan.</s> <s>That's not amnesty, but it suspends pending cases — and whoever eventually drafts the amnesty decides whether atrocities from this war end in a courtroom or a communiqué.</s> <s>Civil society and women's groups are pressing to be in the room where that's written, God willing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Eight hundred and six millimetres of rain fell on the South Korean island of Geoje in two days, and a landslide struck an apartment building before five in the morning, killing a resident and flooding twelve schools.</s> <s>Geoje holds two of the largest shipyards on earth, built on reclaimed coastal flats at sea level, where the subcontracted and migrant workforce lives in the low ground that floods first.</s> <s>Forecasters expect another hundred and fifty millimetres while rescues continue.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Sindh province will import five million tons of wheat to cover a shortfall of one point six nine million.</s> <s>Sindh subsidised farmers to grow more, then its food department procured just eighty-one thousand tons against a target of a million — so the province is buying three times its own gap on the world market, in dollars.</s> <s>The fiscal saving moved from the budget line to the current account, and the risk moved to the household.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In South Africa, councillors in Nelson Mandela Bay voted to write off twenty-three billion rand of unexplained spending, and an opposition councillor walked out rather than take part.</s> <s>South African finance law requires each item to be investigated and recovery attempted before any write-off — a single vote erased the audit trail instead.</s> <s>What can't be traced can't be recovered.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Indian navy has reclaimed the runway at Visakhapatnam, and the last scheduled flight left on Sunday night after decades of civil service from a military airfield.</s> <s>A city of two million switched airports overnight to a new privately built field at Bhogapuram, and such concessions typically bar a competing airport within a fixed radius — the old field closing isn't incidental, it's the revenue model.</s> <s>Passengers usually discover the cost of that arrangement in the fees, and in the drive.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Democratic Republic of Congo's Ebola outbreak has become the deadliest in the country's history, with more than two thousand two hundred and ninety-nine deaths.</s> <s>Nearly half of confirmed cases now die, up from a fifth in June — and Doctors Without Borders says that's late detection and unreachable territory, not a deadlier virus, since two vaccines and two treatments already exist.</s> <s>The case count measures how much of eastern Congo the response simply cannot enter.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Also in eastern Congo, health workers in Uvira logged eleven hundred rapes in three months.</s> <s>Armed groups use rape to empty villages because it's cheaper than fighting to hold them, and gold near four thousand three hundred dollars an ounce keeps funding the groups controlling the mining corridors nearby.</s> <s>The same territorial control that keeps vaccinators out is what makes this possible.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's meteorological department has issued a red alert for twenty more centimetres of rain over northern Odisha, where roughly five hundred and fifteen thousand people are already in floodwater.</s> <s>The Baitarani and Brahmani have breached danger levels — rivers that rise in other states entirely, so the reservoir releases that drown Bhadrak are decided by a government that doesn't answer to Odisha.</s> <s>Odisha's celebrated disaster machinery was built for cyclones, which announce themselves days in advance from the sea.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Meanwhile, this year's El Niño is approaching record strength.</s> <s>Weakened trade winds push the Pacific's warm pool eastward, drying Indonesia and southern Africa while flooding the Horn — rain doesn't vanish, it relocates.</s> <s>Six months of warning is enough time for grain reserves and planting decisions, if governments choose to use it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India may end a decade of free digital payments.</s> <s>Banks and apps have absorbed the cost of every transaction since the Unified Payments Interface launched ten years ago, stripping out the two to three percent toll card networks charge everywhere else — a genuine transfer from finance to the real economy, but one with no revenue line for fraud detection or disputes.</s> <s>A fee of nought point three to nought point five percent on large business transactions is under discussion, and several countries building copies of this rail are importing the same unanswered question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Chemists in London report welding atomically precise metal nanoclusters into three-dimensional structures using a two-photon laser.</s> <s>Assembling such clusters normally destroys the very arrangement that gave them their useful properties, and the finding here is that the ink's viscoelasticity decides whether clusters can move close enough to bond covalently.</s> <s>The manuscript hasn't yet been edited or peer reviewed — but two-photon printing needs no clean room, which puts this frontier within reach of labs outside the countries controlling semiconductor tooling.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>